===============================================================================
3. What is NOT covered, because it is not here
===============================================================================

No license is granted, or implied, for any third-party material that this
repository does not contain and never redistributes:

  * HP / Validity `validity-sensor` and its RAM patches are proprietary and are
    downloaded from HP by the user at setup time. They are not part of this
    project and are not covered by either license above.
  * Reference checkouts under `reference/` are not tracked in this repository;
    if you clone them they keep their own upstream licenses.
  * Captured fingerprint images, USB captures, and session keys are produced
    locally and are never committed.

===============================================================================
4. No warranty, and not a security product
===============================================================================

The Software is provided "as is", with no warranty. It drives real fingerprint
hardware and can be wired into PAM authentication; you are responsible for
keeping a working password fallback and for testing it yourself. See README.md.
